&lt;p&gt;SUKKUR: Mir Ali Murad Khan Talpur, the last ruler of the former princely state of Khairpur, passed away here on Monday. He was 93.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;He has left behind two sons and a daughter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The funeral prayers will be offered at Kot Diji on Tuesday (today) at 11am.&lt
